  "body_markdown": "Follow\n\n(323) 433-5990\n\nHome\n\nServices\n\nAll-On-Four\n\nDental Implants\n\nSedation Dentistry\n\nAbout\n\nFAQ\n\nForms\n\nBlog\n\nContact\n\n\n## \"A beautiful smile leaves lasting impressions.\"\n\n\n-Dr. Igal Elyassi\n\nFounder\n\nBOOK APPOINTMENT\n\nMonday – Friday\n\n8 AM – 6 AM\n\n6200 Wilshire Blvd. #1609\n\nLos Angeles, CA 90048\n\nsmiles@ladentist.com\n\n\n## Serving Los Angeles, Santa Monica, Beverly Hills, West Hollywood, and More\n\n\nDental implants, which are natural-looking replacements for teeth that have been lost or need to be removed, are important to not only maintain a lovely smile, but critical to your overall oral health. Failure to replace missing teeth results in the others moving to try to fill the gap, which causes the deterioration of the underlying jawbone and eventually the loss of other teeth.\n\n\n### Book Your Appointment\n\n\n\n# Dental Implants Los Angeles\n\n\nFortunately, Wilshire Smile Studio in Los Angeles is a highly-regarded specialist in dental implants. A revolution in material and techniques has enabled the team to perfectly match neighboring teeth.\n\n\n### All-on-Four\n\n\nAll-On-Four is a revolutionary new type of implant for those who have lost many of their teeth and are not satisfied with dentures. Instead of the conventional approach of individual implants, our oral surgeon will prepare your upper and lower teeth with just four implants, each with a group of natural-looking replacement teeth.\n\n\n### Sedation Dentistry\n\n\nIf you have missing teeth for whatever reason, you may have heard that dental implants are the best solution because they prevent the natural misalignment of other teeth and erosion of the jaw, just like actual teeth.\n\n\n### We Accept CareCredit\n\n\nAs a service to you, we are pleased to offer and accept CareCredit to begin your treatment immediately and pay for it over time with low monthly payments.\n\n\n## Our Team\n\n\n\n## Dr. Nariman Saadat\n\n\n\n### Oral Surgeon\n\n\n\n## Dr. Igal Elyassi\n\n\n\n### Founder\n\n\n\n## Dr. David Sewell\n\n\n\n### Cosmetic Dentist\n\n\n\n## How Long Do Dental Implants Last? Tips for Maximizing Their Lifespan\n\n\n- Based in Los Angeles -Dental implants are one of the most durable and effective solutions for...\n\nread more\n\n\n## Are Dental Implants Right for You? Key Factors to Consider\n\n\n- Based in Los Angeles -If you're missing one or more teeth, dental implants are a recommended...\n\n\n## Why You Can’t Wait to Replace Missing Teeth With Dental Implants\n\n\nWhy You Can't Wait to Replace Missing Teeth With Dental Implants According to the American...\n\n\n## Our Team\n\n\n\n## Dr. Nariman Saadat\n\n\n\n### Oral Surgeon\n\n\n\n## Dr. Igal Elyassi\n\n\n\n### Founder\n\n\n\n## Dr. David Sewell\n\n\n\n### Cosmetic Dentist\n\n\n\n## Dr. Sara Tanavoli\n\n\n\n### Periodontist\n\n\n\n## Contact Us\n\n\nFull Name *\n\nPhone\n\nMessage\n\nSubmit\n\nWE PROVIDE THIRD PARTY FINANCING\n\n\n#### Services\n\n\nAll-on-Four-Implants\n\n\n#### Useful Links\n\n\n\n#### Contact Us\n\n\n6200 Wilshire Blvd., #1609\n\nCopyright © 2026. Wilshire Smile Studio. All Rights Reserved. The Dental Implant Center of Los Angeles offers sedation dentistry and dental implant surgery, also serving West Hollywood, Santa Monica, Beverly Hills, and more. | Sitemap | Privacy Policy\n\nSkip to content\n\nOpen toolbar\n\nAccessibility Tools\n\nIncrease Text\n\nDecrease Text\n\nGrayscale\n\nHigh Contrast\n\nNegative Contrast\n\nLight Background\n\nLinks Underline\n\nReadable Font\n\nReset",
